.page-section.p-140-cont.grey-light-bg.clearfix(id="pricing-link")
    .container
        h2.section-title 
            span.bold Engagements
        p.lead.text-center.mb-50 Scoping starts with your stack, traffic patterns, and business constraints. Below are typical shapes of work—not shopping-cart SKUs.
        
        .row
            .col-md-4
                .pricing-box.wow.fadeIn.mb-30
                    .pricing-box-header
                        h3 Cost optimization audit
                        .price
                            span.period Fixed scope · 2–4 weeks typical
                    .pricing-box-content
                        ul
                            li Billing and resource inventory across AWS accounts
                            li Waste analysis: Lambda, API Gateway, data transfer, storage
                            li Prioritized remediation list with expected savings bands
                            li Optional implementation support
                        a.btn.btn-md.btn-color(href="#quote-request") Get an AWS cost analysis
            .col-md-4
                .pricing-box.featured.wow.fadeIn.mb-30
                    .pricing-box-header
                        h3 Performance engineering sprint
                        .price
                            span.period Time-boxed · senior engineers
                    .pricing-box-content
                        ul
                            li Production profiling and bottleneck analysis
                            li Go service and distributed systems tuning
                            li Load validation against agreed scenarios
                            li Runbooks and monitoring gaps called out explicitly
                        a.btn.btn-md.btn-color(href="#quote-request") Book a performance audit
            .col-md-4
                .pricing-box.wow.fadeIn.mb-30
                    .pricing-box-header
                        h3 Serverless migration program
                        .price
                            span.period Phased · architecture-first
                    .pricing-box-content
                        ul
                            li Domain boundaries and event design
                            li Lambda, queues, and integration patterns
                            li Cutover plans with rollback and observability
                            li Knowledge transfer for your platform team
                        a.btn.btn-md.btn-color(href="#quote-request") Request a systems review
        
        .row
            .col-md-12.text-center.mt-40
                p.mb-30 If you are unsure where to start, we begin with a short technical review and point you to the right engagement.
                a.btn.btn-lg.btn-color(href="#quote-request") Request a backend systems review
